-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\">),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">홍보비 등 경비 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 39.9pt; line-height: 27.2px; text-indent: -39.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 14pt;\">기자재 등 자산취득성 물품 구입 및 기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 14pt;\">단체</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 14pt;\">운영비 지원 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 27.2px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">사업기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt;\">보조금 교부결정일로부터&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt;\">2022. 12</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt;\">월까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 113.1pt; line-height: 27.2px; text-indent: -113.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">사업목적&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 15pt;\">도내 청소년들의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spac